==Bulgarian==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|cu|bg}} {{term|чрънъ|lang=cu}}, from {{proto|Slavic|čьrnъ|lang=bg}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|krsnos|lang=bg}}. Cognates include Serbo-Croatian {{term|црн|lang=sh}}/{{term|crn|lang=sh}}, Slovene {{term|črn|lang=sl}}, Slovak {{term|čierny}}; Sanskrit {{term|कृष्ण|tr=kṛṣṇá|sc=Deva}}, Old Prussian {{term|kirsnan||black|lang=prg}}.

